      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DALGETY (1) goes very well here including two wins. Below best last time at Q Lakeside (25.29) in a OPEN, finishing a 5 length fourth. Looks suited here and rates on top. GONZO (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (35.29) at this track behind Bentley Kristoff in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Expected to feature. MIDNIGHT QUEEN (7) hit the ground running to win over the 642m at Q Lakeside two runs back then settled forward again when finishing second at Q Lakeside last start. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Can feature again. TO XIBALBA (8) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
